<h2 class="wsite-content-title" style="text-align:center;"><strong><font size="5">&nbsp;Marty Smith Sports Camps - Ocala, Florida</font><br /></strong></h2>

<h2 class="wsite-content-title" style="text-align:center;"><strong><u><font style="color:rgb(241, 15, 15)"><font size="5">Interested in playing baseball at a Florida Juco?<br />Get seen by 12 Florida Jucos in a 2-day showcase.</font></font></u></strong><br />Juco Super Showcase - Dec. 12-13, 2026<br />Day 1 - Recruit talk, combine, Game, Pizza with the coaches<br />Day 2 - Two games<font size="6">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><a href="/registration-page.html">CLICK&nbsp;HERE</a></font><a href="/registration-page.html">&nbsp;</a><font size="6" style="color:rgb(168, 46, 46)"><a href="/registration-page.html">TO REGISTER</a></font><br /><strong><u><font color="#33a27f" size="5">FLORIDA JUCO SHOWCASE - One UPCOMING SHOWCASES</font></u></strong><br /><strong><font size="6"><font color="#a82e2e">____________________________________________________</font></font></strong><br /><u><strong><font color="#200fd4" size="5">Dec. 12-13, 2026 - LAKE MYRTLE FALL SHOWCASE<br />LAKE MYRTLE COMPLEX - AUBURNDALE, FLORIDA&nbsp;<br />&#8203;2701 LAKE MYRTLE PARK ROAD, AUBURNDALE, FL</font></strong></u><br /><br /><font color="#2413d8"><u><strong>FOR HIGH SCHOOL PLAYERS, TRANSFERS, AND POST-GRADS</strong></u><br />MINIMUM OF 12 JUCO COACHES from 12 different colleges.<br />(SEE BELOW for coaches attending) WILL BE&nbsp;RUNNING THE SHOWCASE,&nbsp;<br />LOOKING&nbsp;TO RECRUIT 2027, 2028 GRADS, TRANSFERS AND POST-GRADS.<br /><strong>SHOWCASE IS LIMITED AND POSITIONS CLOSE AS THEY FILL&nbsp;</strong><br /><br /><u><strong>REGISTRATION PRICES BELOW</strong></u><br /><u><strong>Position player/Dual position player</strong></u> - COST IS (EARLY REGISTRATION&nbsp;discount $365 TILL Nov. 1) $395 November 2 AND AFTER<br /><u><strong>"Pitcher only"</strong></u> - COST IS ($175 EARLY registration discount TILL Nov. 1) $195 November 2 AND AFTER<br />"PITCHER ONLY" GUYS WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE MORNING RECRUITING CHAT WITH PARENTS/PLAYERS AND COACHES AND will participate in the infield part of the combine.</font><br /><br /><strong style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">SCHEDULE OF EVENTS</span></strong><br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>SATURDAY, DEC. 12</u></strong><br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>8:15</u></strong>&nbsp;- CHECK IN, PICK UP T-SHIRT, REPORT TO ASSIGNED DUGOUT<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>9:00</u></strong>&nbsp;- INTRODUCTION OF COACHES AND RECRUITING CHAT<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>9:40</u></strong>&nbsp;- COMBINE - 60 TIMES, OUTFIELDERS FIELD AND THROW, INFIELDERS FIELD AND THROW,&nbsp;BP ON FIELD.<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>12:00</u></strong>&nbsp;- GAME 1&nbsp;<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>2:30</u></strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><em>PIZZA WITH THE COACHES &nbsp;ON THE FIELD(PARENTS AND PLAYERS INVITED)</em></strong><br /><br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><u>SUNDAY, DEC. 13</u></strong><br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">8:45</strong>&nbsp;- REPORT TO FIELDS (CATCHERS EARLIER)<br />BEFORE SUNDAY GAMES CATCHERS WILL THROW FOR POP TIMES<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">9:30</strong>&nbsp;- GAME 2<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">11:30</strong>&nbsp;- GAME 3&nbsp;<br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)">2:00</strong>&nbsp;- APPROXIMATE CAMP END TIME<br /><br /><strong style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"><em><u>12 JUCO COACHES ATTENDING THE 2026 FLORIDA JUCO SUPER SHOWCASE</u></em></strong><br />COLLEGE OF CENTRAL FLORIDA -&nbsp;OCALA, FL - HEAD COACH&nbsp;MARTY&nbsp;SMITH<br />LAKE SUMTER STATE COLLEGE - LEESBURG, FL - HEAD COACH RICH BILLINGS<br />FLORIDA STATE COLLEGE @ JACKSONVILLE - JACKSONVILLE, FL - HEAD COACH BRAD FRICK<br />SOUTH FLORIDA STATE COLLEGE - AVON PARK, FL - HEAD COACH RICK HITT&nbsp;<br />POLK STATE COLLEGE - WINTER HAVEN, FL - HEAD COACH AL CORBEIL<br />&#8203;EASTERN FLORIDA STATE COLLEGE - MELBOURNE, FL - HEAD COACH MITCH GALLAGHER<br />HILLSBOROUGH CC - TAMPA, FL &nbsp;- HEAD COACH RAYDON LEATON<br />SOUTH GEORGIA STATE COLLEGE - DOUGLAS, GA. - ASST. COACH BRADLEY CAMMACK<br />STATE COLLEGE OF FLORIDA - BRADENTON, FL - HEAD COACH TIM HILL<br />Santa Fe College - Gainesville, FL - Asst. Coach Ryan&nbsp;Pettys<br />Abraham Baldwin Agricultural College - Tifton, GA, Asst. Coach Adam Biss<br />Palm Beach State College - West Palm Beach, FL - Head Coach Corey Thompson<br /><br /></h2>

